NarrativeShield-SDoH: licensing

1. Retellings, annotations and derived data (dataset/, Annotations/, results/)
   Creative Commons Attribution-NonCommercial 4.0 International (CC BY-NC 4.0)
   https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc/4.0/legalcode
   You may share and adapt this material for NON-COMMERCIAL research purposes
   only, with attribution. The underlying questions come from MedQA-USMLE
   (Jin et al., 2020, https://github.com/jind11/MedQA); users must also
   comply with the MedQA terms. The retellings were generated with a Gemini
   model via a hosted API; users should check that provider's terms of use.

2. Code (codes/, slurm/, results/analysis/*.py)
   Released for NON-COMMERCIAL research use only, with attribution to this
   work and to MedQA (Jin et al., 2020). Provided "as is", without warranty
   of any kind.

3. Not for clinical use. The data are synthetic and the models and pipelines
   evaluated here are not intended for unsupervised clinical use.

Third-party models (Hugging Face checkpoints) keep their own licenses.
